# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: Other | Scene: HuntingTheBeast3

translate pt strings:

    old "A pained smile on his face."
    new "Um sorriso doloroso no rosto dele."

    old "A curse that would heal my wounds, save my life and make me a creature of the forest. A Beast."
    new "Uma maldição que curaria minhas feridas, salvaria minha vida e me tornaria uma criatura da floresta. Uma Besta."

    old "A great metal chain ran around it, shattered and broken, some of the links were sprawled out across the grass."
    new "Uma grande corrente de metal a rodeava, partida e quebrada; alguns dos elos estavam espalhados pelo gramado."

    old "Do as he asks, kill him"
    new "Faça o que ele pede, mate-o"

    old "There must be another way"
    new "Há que haver outra forma"

    old "A deep groan of pain roared out from his throat as he collapsed to the ground."
    new "Um gemido profundo de dor rugiu de sua garganta enquanto ele desmaiava no chão."
